"""ScrollWheelSpring Native XParent_003 — strict-SROT pure Build123d port.

Source-independent engineering feature. Geometry is constructed only from identified
analytic STEP supports and deterministic intersections/tangencies. No reference CAD,
correction geometry, serialized B-Rep, external geometry replay,
or external geometry helper is read at runtime.

Feature law (source-proven):
  torus -> F127 R0.5 -> F157 R0.4 -> F134 R2 -> F139 R1 -> F061 R5
  -> F142 R1 -> F141 R2 -> F146 R0.4 -> F115 R0.5 -> torus -> exact closure

The section/path ranking samples generated analytic intersection edges only to choose the
correct engineering branch. Sampled points never define or approximate production curves.
"""
